  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &quot;st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos CSO f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja h&#xe5;llbar          f&#xf6;rvaltning i Liberia&quot; syftar till att bygga den institutionella,     organisation och teknisk kompetens tio liberianska det civila         samh&#xe4;llets organisationer i Liberia. Dessutom kommer programmet att   st&#xf6;dja utvecklingen av regelbundna dialogplattformar genom vilka det  civila samh&#xe4;llets organisationer i Liberia kan ha m&#xf6;jlighet att konst</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &apos;Strengthening the capacity of CSO to promote sustainable Governance in Liberia&apos; aims to build the institutional,               organizational and technical competency of ten Liberian civil society organizations in Liberia. In addition, the programme will support the development of regular dialogue platforms through which CSOs in       Liberia can be able to constructively engage with the State,private s</narrative>
  </description>
